# How to Identify the Correct Window Pattern

## Case 1: The window size is given

```text
"subarray of size k"
"substring of length k"
```

Use:

```text
Fixed-size sliding window
```

---

## Case 2: Find the longest valid window

```text
"longest substring without..."
"maximum subarray with at most..."
```

Use:

```text
Expand right
Shrink while invalid
Update maximum after shrinking
```

---

## Case 3: Find the shortest valid window

```text
"minimum-length subarray with..."
"smallest substring containing..."
```

Use:

```text
Expand until valid
Update minimum while valid
Shrink left
```

---

## Case 4: Check whether a permutation exists

Use:

```text
Fixed-size window
Frequency comparison
```

