# Quick Revision Cheat Sheet

```text
SLIDING WINDOW = contiguous range between left and right

Fixed window:
    Window size is given.
    Add right.
    Remove left when size > k.
    Process when size == k.

Longest/maximum window:
    Add right.
    Shrink while INVALID.
    Update maximum after shrinking.

Shortest/minimum window:
    Add right.
    While VALID:
        Update minimum.
        Remove left.
        Move left.

Window length:
    right - left + 1

Common storage:
    Sum            → Running integer
    Unique values  → HashSet
    Frequencies    → HashMap or array
    Distinct count → HashMap size

Time complexity:
    Usually O(n), because left and right move only forward.
```

